The validated panel list (panels.txt) and the EDID range-patching logic (edid.awk,
and the parts of fix.sh that use them) in this folder are derived, via ClawDeck's
edid.py, from the Intel VRR range fix in Zendo-GIT/Intel-Handheld-and-ARC-GPU-laboratory
(https://github.com/Zendo-GIT/Intel-Handheld-and-ARC-GPU-laboratory, checked at commit
cf5fb4145c2af3d8cd00c5b51e38019dae371948). That project's license notice:

